<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AirTouch started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AirTouch started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of AirTouch Communications Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown analyst Brian Coleman was not immediately available to provide additional details.</p>
<p>-- AirTouch gained 1-1/8 to 27-3/4.</p>
